WEBVTT

00:25:29.470 --> 00:25:32.612
and making information freely available.

00:25:32.636 --> 00:25:34.776
And what's the CIA about?

00:25:34.800 --> 00:25:36.320
Well, not that.

00:25:36.344 --> 00:25:37.698
(Music)

00:25:39.190 --> 00:25:41.806
AG: This is another type of authenticity:

00:25:41.830 --> 00:25:43.180
nonconformity.

00:25:43.783 --> 00:25:47.286
When you act differently
than your organization's norms dictate,

00:25:47.310 --> 00:25:50.576
like swearing on a team
that avoids profanity,

00:25:50.600 --> 00:25:53.983
publicly calling out errors
in an office that favors privacy

00:25:54.840 --> 00:25:56.496
or quietly going home each night

00:25:56.520 --> 00:25:58.670
when all your coworkers
head to happy hour.

00:25:59.730 --> 00:26:02.026
Sure, you want to be authentic.